{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/text.gif?t=1751566240\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The New Name of Trade, Strategy, and Adventure: Trade Tycoon Life Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your shop in the city, master negotiations, and grow rich with smart strategies in <i>Trade Tycoon Life Simulator</i>! Keep a close eye on material offers coming from every corner of the city \u2014 from home goods to industrial supplies, everything comes your way. Buying low and selling high might make you a successful entrepreneur\u2026 or drag you into the chaos of a warehouse war!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Negotiation &amp; Trade:</strong> Bargain with customers to buy goods and resell them for high profits. Make the right choices to maximize your earnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Warehouse Wars:</strong> Compete with rivals in strategic warehouse battles to gain valuable materials and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Shop &amp; Vehicle Upgrades:</strong> Expand your store, add new products, and buy vehicles to grow your business even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Racing &amp; Competition:</strong> Join car races in the city, show your speed, and gain prestige. Winning races brings both rewards and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Extra Activities:</strong> Step away from trading and explore other adventures like fishing, working as a courier, and much more around the city.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608020?t=1751566240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608020?t=1751566240","capsule_image":"https